      "statusChangeNewStatus": "interested",
      "value": "This could be done in theory with elbow trackers but would most likely cause too much motion to the point that people would think the shoulders are broken when elbow trackers are active. I'm considering implementing that into \"Lock All\" mode because in general that's where the \"too much tracking data might cause an odd pose\" stuff fits.\nDoes this sound like something the community would want?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
