      "mergedPostDetails": "With 8 point tracking (elbow trackers) the shoulders don't seem to have enough freedom when the arms are down. When I perform a shrug, instead of the IK solution rotating the shoulder bones upward the solver chooses to move the elbows backwards away from the tracked point. It almost feels like it degrades back to 6 point tracking for that one motion.",
